    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#2",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Medics, former South Paci Plaza, exit 12. One injured, a senior L.G.D. inspector. Get here quickly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Has the bleeding stopped?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You should know me by now. The wound has closed, but I won't be able to lift my shield for a while.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "How are our colleages doing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We were the only ones who fell. I consider that a small win.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're really not bringing me with you? Reunion's commander may well be hiding inside the L.G.D. Headquarters. It's going to be a brutal fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm aware. But considering your condition, it's for the best. Wouldn't you agree?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hearing you say that stings a bit, but it's fine. I know better.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Remember, be careful out there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter how you look at it, Reunion is weaker than we expected. Despite that, they still managed to take Chernobog.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Also, you have a weak point. I can't stress this enough, but never let your thoughts consume you. Ever.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't be so obsessed with something that you neglect the other possibilities. There is nothing out there worth going off to battle for, except for your continued existence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll treat this as your advice to me. I'll take it to heart.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hurry up and get better. I'll be waiting for your return after this mission is finished.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll protect the medic team. You should get going.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Radio Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion has already passed the Causeway Bell.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Radio Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Report from AU7: Reunion is also assembling in Ha Wan. I repeat, Reunion is currently assembling. This is AU7's mission briefing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Radio Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Squad AO3 has eliminated the Reunion forces in Front Bay as planned. They are now pushing the remnants back towards the L.G.D. Headquarters.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Radio Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "All enemies in front of Scorpio Palace have been annihilated. Now retreating towards Charles Avenue to head to the rally point. This is Squad AL1's report, over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Radio Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Radio Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "These are the updates on Reunion's movements and each squad's progress.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Radio Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Radio Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Continue the operation. Our objective is to drive all Reunion forces into the designated area.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "If small groups of stragglers are seen in other districts, you are authorized to eliminate them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Try to draw them out if possible. Focus on avoiding casualties. We'll need to preserve our strength.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes ma'am.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Radio Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm? Another call?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "offsetx": -300,
        "width": 200,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Hello, hello? Is this Ah Ch'en? Are you still there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What did you call me?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah Ch'en. You're done for! You're so dead for what happened at Paci Plaza. I heard it myself - you were the one who gave those orders!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that all you wanted to say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Look, why did you reject Rhodes Island's help? Was it because you felt guilty?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't recall you being a psychologist.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry, I'll help you make reparations.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Reparations?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hehe, I can't tell you yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, you're so done for because of what you did!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "By the way, do you still remember that one restaurant in Sheung Wan?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Which one? Well, whichever one it is, they're all closed now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait... are you trying to change the subject?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The one with that absolutely divine steak sandwich.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Oh... OHH! I just remembered! The restaurant with a steak burger as big as your palms put side by side!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's the one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I used to go there quite often while on my patrols... Get down! Who said you could stand up?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aaah!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "What was that place called again? Goodie Foodie?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sounds about right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Aha, now I get it. You're going to treat me to a meal, aren't you? But why don't we go to some place a bit more high-class?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Your idea of 'high-class' is very different from mine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Come on, I can foot the bill.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss S, do you really think I'm that kind of person?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you want to try calling me that again?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, I bit my tongue.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You clearly did that on purpose!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Swire, I was just thinking... If we don't do a better job this time, we won't be able to face the locals.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our businesses depend on Lungmen, and Lungmen also depends on them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If you feel that way, you should stop running your mouth. The sooner we take down Reunion, the sooner you can treat me to brunch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Seems like the fighting is pretty intense on your end as well?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, it's fine. I can handle it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "text": "Quick! They're about to get away!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "How annoying! Hey, hurry it up! We don't have all day!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah Ch'en! I want a steak, tomato, and egg burger!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No problem.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry for accidentally locking you up in the vault that other time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You call that an accident? ! I know you did that on purpose! Whatever, it felt cathartic splashing water all over you this morning, so I guess we're even.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Ah Ch'en.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Safety first. Don't throw your life away for the sake of what's immediately in front of you. Remember that there are lots of people who are counting on you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph, is that so. Thanks for your advice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Now that you're in front of the restaurant, that means you're almost at the L.G.D. Headquarters, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Good luck.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
