    {
        "text": "7:40 P.M. \\ Overcast",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "text": "670m east of L.G.D. Headquarters, Upper Factor St., Upper Lungmen",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg"
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Ch'en, Fourth Mobile Squad reporting in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good work.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "All of you assembled here are the cream of the crop. As we speak, many of our colleagues are still out there fighting. But we have our own mission.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "The building in front of us used to be the symbol of Lungmen's safety \u2014 the embodiment of law and order, the heart of the L.G.D.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "But now, it has fallen into Reunion's hands, and has been tainted by conspiracy and warfare.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Some of you might see this as just another job. Some of you might be saddened, while others might be enraged.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "bg_5_6_police",
        "fadetime": 0,
        "xScale": 1,
        "yScale": 1
    },
    {
